        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic 2 Bed / 1 Bath apartment to the rental market, located right in the heart of Rathmines, Dublin 6.\nThis newly refurbed property comprises a bright, spacious open-plan living/dining area, a fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, two well-proportioned double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, a fully tiled bathroom, and a large sunlit outdoor terrace a rare find for this location! \nSituated in one of Dublin's most sought-after and vibrant suburbs, Grosvenor Place is ideally located just off Rathmines Road. It is within a 5-10 minute walk of Rathmines village providing a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurant, bars, and The Swan Shopping Centre. In terms of transport, Ranelagh Luas stop is just a 10-15 minute walk away for direct access to Dublin City Centre, which can also be reached in 30 minutes on foot or 10 minutes by bike. \nFeatures:\n1.2 Bed / 1 Bath Apartment\n2.Completely refurbished to a high standard throughout\n3.Fully Furnished \n4.On-street Parking (eligible for DCC permit)\n5.Large Open-Plan Living/Dining Area\n6.Fully Fitted Kitchen with Integrated Appliances incl. Dishwasher\n7.Highly Sought-After Location\n8.Large Sunlit Private Terrace\n9.Walking distance to Shops, Cafes, Restaurants & Bars\n10.15 min walk to Ranelagh Luas Stop\n11.30 min walk to Dublin City Centre\n12.Excellent Dublin Bus Links of its Doorstep\nViewing highly advised!\n"
